id: pm-graph-asgr
title: Enable governance duplicate-detection advisory mode and adopt pm-cli 2026.7.25
description: "Enable governance.duplicate_detection_mode=advisory so agents filing items get a near-duplicate warning at create time. Bump @unbrained/pm-cli devDependency to ^2026.7.25 (peerDependencies left at >=2026.7.10 as intentionally wider). Advisory mode is non-blocking: appends likely_duplicates warning, never fails a create."
